Skip duplicate transactions on import based on date, description, and amount

- Pre-loads existing (date, description, amount) keys for the account into
  a set for O(1) duplicate checks per row
- Also detects in-file duplicates (same row appearing twice in one CSV)
- Reports duplicate count in the import redirect and displays it on the
  account detail page alongside imported/categorized counts
- Dedup check uses final stored amount (after liability sign-flip)
